### Health check

# Teacher Portal P2 variables: teacherAccessToken, studentAccessToken, courseId, submissionId, joinCode

### My teaching courses
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Create course (Draft)
POST {{host}}/api/teacher/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectName": "Algorithms", "sectionCode": "ITEC-2026-01", "language": "python", "semester": "HK1-2026", "capacity": 60 }

### Course details and join code
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Open course (use Closed to close)
PUT {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Active" }

### Add student
POST {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@hanu.edu.vn" }

### Student joins using code
POST {{host}}/api/student/courses/join
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}" }

### Student courses
GET {{host}}/api/student/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}

### Course roster
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Drop enrollment (preserve submissions)
DELETE {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/students/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Assign an exercise with sample and hidden tests
POST {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Echo input", "difficulty": "Easy", "description": "Read one line and print it.",
  "constraints": "Input length <= 1000", "starterCode": "print(input())",
  "timeLimitMs": 1000, "memoryLimitKb": 65536,
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "hello", "expectedOutput": "hello", "isSample": true, "explanation": "Echo the same line" },
    { "input": "hidden", "expectedOutput": "hidden", "isSample": false, "explanation": null }
  ]
}

### Assigned exercises (student)
GET {{host}}/api/student/courses/{{courseId}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{studentAccessToken}}

### Course submissions
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Source and test results
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Manual grading
PUT {{host}}/api/teacher/courses/{{courseId}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 8.25, "feedback": "Good solution. Explain the complexity." }

### Managed academic classes
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Academic class students (replace classId)
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/classes/{{classId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherAccessToken}}

### Health check

GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Root

GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Redis health check (Round-trip test)

GET {{host}}/health/redis
Accept: application/json

### Users module health

GET {{host}}/api/users/health
Accept: application/json

### Auth module health

GET {{host}}/api/auth/health
Accept: application/json

### Refresh session (refresh token is read only from the HttpOnly cookie)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Logout is anonymous and idempotent (cookie-only refresh token)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

### Logout every session (requires a current access token)

POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List pending teachers (AdminOnly)

# Explicit cursor/limit retains the legacy contract. Omit both for offset pagination.

GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers?status=Pending&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Search teachers with offset pagination (optional facultyId GUID)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers?page=1&pageSize=20&search=GV&sortBy=name_asc&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Teacher KPI
GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Faculties for the teacher form
GET {{host}}/api/admin/faculties
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Teacher profile and assignments
GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Create a verified teacher (replace temporary password before use)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Teacher",
  "email": "test.teacher@hanu.edu.vn",
  "teacherId": "GV-TEST-001",
  "facultyId": null,
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "bio": "Software Engineering",
  "temporaryPassword": "ReplaceWithSecurePassword1!",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Update teacher profile (status changes use workflow endpoints)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Updated Teacher",
  "teacherId": "GV-TEST-001",
  "facultyId": null,
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "bio": "Updated profile"
}

### Enable a disabled account; older tokens remain invalid
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Approve a selection atomically (1 to 100 distinct verified pending teachers)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/bulk-approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": ["{{userId}}"] }

### Disable a selection atomically (active teachers only)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/bulk-disable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": ["{{userId}}"] }

### Export ALL matching teachers, independent of the visible page
GET {{host}}/api/admin/teachers/export?status=Active&sortBy=name_asc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Approve a pending teacher (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Reject a pending teacher (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Disable an active user (AdminOnly)

POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Trace status changes for a user (AdminOnly)

GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-logs?targetUserId={{userId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
